  "cues": [
    {
      "scene": "open",
      "text": "Give an AI agent a repo it can actually understand,",
      "start": 1,
      "end": 4.42,
      "out": 4.46
    },
    {
      "scene": "open",
      "text": "and a harness it can't escape.",
      "start": 4.46,
      "end": 6.094,
      "out": 6.894
    },
    {
      "scene": "frame",
      "text": "Teams putting agents on real work keep asking the same few questions.",
      "start": 7.744,
      "end": 11.653,
      "out": 12.203
    },
    {
      "scene": "frame",
      "text": "Here they are, with what answers each one.",
      "start": 12.203,
      "end": 14.322,
      "out": 15.122
    },
    {
      "scene": "team",
      "text": "First, the team.",
      "start": 15.972,
      "end": 17.14,
      "out": 17.69
    },
    {
      "scene": "team",
      "text": "\"I want an agent team that fits my project.\"",
      "start": 17.69,
      "end": 20.414,
      "out": 20.964
    },
    {
      "scene": "team",
      "text": "harness-bootstrap reads your code first, then asks what the repo is for: code, research, strategy, or docs.",
      "start": 20.964,
      "end": 27.979,
      "out": 28.529
    },
    {
      "scene": "team",
      "text": "One dev seat per real module. Never every seat by default.",
      "start": 28.529,
      "end": 32.535,
      "out": 33.335
    },
    {
      "scene": "safe",
      "text": "Next, safety and cost.",
      "start": 34.185,
      "end": 35.828,
      "out": 36.378
    },
    {
      "scene": "safe",
      "text": "\"I want it safe, without it overthinking or burning tokens.\"",
      "start": 36.378,
      "end": 39.913,
      "out": 40.463
    },
    {
      "scene": "safe",
      "text": "Hooks block in the shell, so no model gets a say.",
      "start": 40.463,
      "end": 43.226,
      "out": 43.776
    },
    {
      "scene": "safe",
      "text": "A force push to main? Refused, by default.",
      "start": 43.776,
      "end": 46.577,
      "out": 46.66
    },
    {
      "scene": "lean",
      "text": "verify-plan reads the diff and asks only for the checks it needs.",
      "start": 46.743,
      "end": 51.48,
      "out": 52.03
    },
    {
      "scene": "lean",
      "text": "The ledger won't re-review what already passed, and review rounds are capped.",
      "start": 52.03,
      "end": 56.243,
      "out": 56.793
    },
    {
      "scene": "lean",
      "text": "Every seat pins its model, effort and tools.",
      "start": 56.793,
      "end": 59.756,
      "out": 60.556
    },
    {
      "scene": "keys",
      "text": "Then, secrets.",
      "start": 61.406,
      "end": 62.379,
      "out": 62.929
    },
    {
      "scene": "keys",
      "text": "\"I'm worried about leaking keys.\"",
      "start": 62.929,
      "end": 64.699,
      "out": 65.249
    },
    {
      "scene": "keys",
      "text": "protect-secrets blocks reads of env files and keys.",
      "start": 65.249,
      "end": 68.545,
      "out": 69.095
    },
    {
      "scene": "keys",
      "text": "env-read runs a command with the values loaded, and redacts them from the output.",
      "start": 69.095,
      "end": 73.626,
      "out": 74.426
    },
    {
      "scene": "loop",
      "text": "Now, how the work flows.",
      "start": 75.276,
      "end": 76.8,
      "out": 77.35
    },
    {
      "scene": "loop",
      "text": "\"Traditional SDLC makes every task a struggle, and AI-DLC ends up half-hearted.\"",
      "start": 77.35,
      "end": 83.057,
      "out": 83.607
    },
    {
      "scene": "loop",
      "text": "Here the spec is the oracle of one loop: requirement, task, implement, verify, review, done.",
      "start": 83.607,
      "end": 90.885,
      "out": 91.435
    },
    {
      "scene": "loop",
      "text": "Ceremony follows the change: a small edit stays inline, a schema change gets the guarded flow.",
      "start": 91.435,
      "end": 97.449,
      "out": 98.249
    },
    {
      "scene": "spec",
      "text": "Then, the spec.",
      "start": 99.099,
      "end": 100.016,
      "out": 100.566
    },
    {
      "scene": "spec",
      "text": "\"I want specs a human can confirm and an AI can understand.\"",
      "start": 100.566,
      "end": 104.847,
      "out": 105.122
    },
    {
      "scene": "spec",
      "text": "spec-builder writes one contract: a plain-words sheet the client answers, and an index agents read first.",
      "start": 105.122,
      "end": 111.577,
      "out": 112.127
    },
    {
      "scene": "spec",
      "text": "Anything unknown is flagged, never invented.",
      "start": 112.127,
      "end": 114.758,
      "out": 115.558
    },
    {
      "scene": "control",
      "text": "Next, seeing inside.",
      "start": 116.408,
      "end": 117.815,
      "out": 118.365
    },
    {
      "scene": "control",
      "text": "\"I want to understand and control how the agents work, in depth.\"",
      "start": 118.365,
      "end": 121.919,
      "out": 122.469
    },
    {
      "scene": "control",
      "text": "harness-view draws every agent, rule, hook and module as a live graph, read off disk.",
      "start": 122.469,
      "end": 128.342,
      "out": 128.892
    },
    {
      "scene": "control",
      "text": "Switch any part off safely, and every finished subagent run is archived.",
      "start": 128.892,
      "end": 133.6,
      "out": 134.4
    },
    {
      "scene": "assess",
      "text": "And last, the check.",
      "start": 135.25,
      "end": 136.555,
      "out": 137.105
    },
    {
      "scene": "assess",
      "text": "\"Once built, it's too much to check, slow to fix, and the score is vague.\"",
      "start": 137.105,
      "end": 141.604,
      "out": 142.154
    },
    {
      "scene": "assess",
      "text": "harness-view assess turns that into a worklist, with one-click fixes and what changed since last time.",
      "start": 142.154,
      "end": 148.207,
      "out": 148.757
    },
    {
      "scene": "assess",
      "text": "Every finding has a rule ID, its file and line, and the fix, from a published rubric.",
      "start": 148.757,
      "end": 154.626,
      "out": 155.426
    },
    {
      "scene": "close",
      "text": "A repo it can actually understand. A harness it can't escape.",
      "start": 156.276,
      "end": 160.32,
      "out": 161.12
    }
  ],
